  data: {
    LLM: 'Top cards of tableau piles are available. Build tableaus down in sequence regardless of suit or color. Build foundations up in suit from Ace to King. An empty tableau pile may be filled with any single available card. Move cards between tableaus and from tableaus to foundations until all 52 cards are on the foundations.',
    Player: 'Top cards of tableau piles are available. Build tableaus down in sequence regardless of suit or color. Build foundations up in suit from Ace to King. An empty tableau pile may be filled with any single available card. Move cards between tableaus and from tableaus to foundations until all 52 cards are on the foundations.',
    objective: 'Move all 52 cards onto the four foundations. Build each foundation up in suit from Ace to King; the game is won when every card has been moved to the foundations.',
    gameplay: 'Top cards of tableau piles are available. Build tableaus down in sequence regardless of suit or color. Build foundations up in suit from Ace to King. An empty tableau pile may be filled with any single available card. Move cards between tableaus and from tableaus to foundations until all 52 cards are on the foundations.',
    keyRules: [
      'Tableau builds down regardless of suit.',
      'Foundations build up in suit from Ace.',
      'Empty tableau may hold any one card.',
      'Only the top card of each tableau is available.',
    ],
