    turnFlow: 'Top cards of tableau piles are available. Build tableaus down in sequence regardless of suit or color. Build foundations up in suit from Ace to King. An empty tableau pile may be filled with any single available card. Move cards between tableaus and from tableaus to foundations until all 52 cards are on the foundations.',
